AUTHORSHIP NOTE

Portions of the API and script reference documentation in this directory were
drafted with the assistance of a large language model and subsequently
reviewed, corrected, and edited by the author. Copyright protection for
machine-generated text is unsettled in the United States; the copyright
asserted here extends to the author's selection, arrangement, correction, and
editorial contribution.

Documents that are substantially the author's own writing are listed in
docs/README.md. Where a document is largely unedited generated output, this
notice should be read as a statement of intent rather than a settled claim of
exclusive right.


